  "body": "Among the fine homes in Long Bay, this residence offers a wonderful opportunity for modern family living. Perfectly positioned within this highly sought-after coastal community, it enjoys exceptional all-day natural light and a seamless indoor-outdoor connection. Designed with privacy, quality, and refined elegance in mind, every detail of this home has been custom-selected to create an atmosphere of understated luxury.  \r\n\r\nInside, the ground floor centres around a bright open-plan living and dining area that flows smoothly to the outdoors and a gourmet designer kitchen. Both the main kitchen and upper-level wet bar feature exquisite stone benchtops, adding timeless texture and sophisticated functionality. A highly practical secondary scullery and a guest powder room add ultimate everyday convenience. Completing the lower level is a private ground-floor master suite featuring its own ensuite and wardrobe—ideal for extended family or hosting guests.  \r\n\r\nUpstairs, the home opens up to a second spacious family living area complete with a wet bar for effortless entertaining, all while capturing relaxing sea and neighborhood vistas across the local landscape. The primary master suite on this level is a true retreat, featuring a lavish ensuite and walk-in wardrobe. Alongside it, a second upper-level suite with its own ensuite serves as a perfect guest or teenager’s haven. Two additional bedrooms and a stylish family bathroom complete this upper level. Throughout the home, the exceptional craftsmanship is elevated by wide-plank engineered timber flooring, quality stone sink, and high-end tapware.\r\n\r\nBeyond the home, the vibrant Long Bay location adds even more appeal. A local community playground is only a short walk away, while Long Bay Village, local cafes, top-tier schooling, the beach, and the regional park are all just moments from your doorstep—offering the perfect balance of coastal beauty, urban convenience, and modern lifestyle.  \r\n\r\nThis is a rare opportunity to secure a home crafted with exceptional quality, thoughtful care, and enduring style. Contact us today to arrange your private viewing.",
